 YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n            关于El Diviso\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          El Diviso位于慧兰的Pitalito镇，庄园的主人Jose Uribe Lasso为了远离暴力的生活环境，从娜玲珑搬到了Pitalito，于2000年初购得了El Diviso，开始新的生活篇章。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          选择慧兰，是因为肥沃的土壤与健康多样的生态环境，给了Jose信心，只要努力，种咖啡或者其它任何作物都可以很好的生活下去。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RAEdlib7TPwnZRwUYPMiazrrDakjia9uA52xMia1vtBTUePheRCCMhyuprEcpwiciarkzFoucU3f2q6M9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Jose将庄园分割了不同的地块分别给它的3个儿子，让他们选择想种的咖啡品种，鼓励他们自己选择合适的处理加工方式，现在庄园里有种植的品种有哥伦比亚，瑰夏，爪哇，卡杜拉，Tabi，Chiroso，粉波旁和Bourbon Aji（辣椒波旁）等。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RAEdlib7TPwnZRwUYPMiazrrEwezJhx57YSDsicmTABZLduCPCW4NmDoFxSicPybVZ56ATYGgVnB1wyg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          新种下去的Caturra Chiroso\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YUniccGB66DxC3Ixnf7YLxkz3PDzJwQricOh0PdIXYVlCPgib3lZYgDI33Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
